  "title": "Texas Guard, Czech firefighters and U.S. task forces conduct multi-day flood search across Central Texas",
  "description": "Soldiers and Airmen with the Texas National Guard’s 454th Engineer Company and 640th Small Unmanned Aerial Systems Detachment, Delta Flight, conduct coordinated search operations alongside Czech firefighters, Missouri and Indiana Task Force responders. From July 15–19, 2025, teams operated in flood-affected areas near the Guadalupe River and surrounding communities, using drone reconnaissance, search dogs and engineer support to assist local authorities in locating missing persons. The Czech team deployed under the Texas–Czechia State Partnership Program. (U.S. Army video by Sgt. 1st Class Christy L. Sherman)",
